    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>ARCHETYPE UNLIVING</p>\n<p>Prerequisites Level 2</p>\n<p>Your corpse has been preserved by funerary rites, embalming curses and the dry patience of the tomb.</p>\n<p>You are bound together by linen, resin, grave-dust and old ritual power. Your body no longer rots in the ordinary manner; it endures as a sealed relic of death, stubbornly resistant to blade and hammer but vulnerable to cleansing flame. You gain the Shared Unliving Base Mods, Resistance to Physical damage and Weakness to Fire.</p>\n<p>Grants Darkvision and the Shared Unliving Base Mods; resistance to physical damage (bludgeoning, piercing, slashing) and weakness to fire. One Unliving archetype per character.</p>",
